# Giant Beaver: the trigger needs "attacks while saddled" (CR 702.171b): attacking unsaddled puts nothing on the stack and no counter anywhere. It also keeps vigilance.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Giant Beaver
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giant Beaver.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Giant Beaver > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Giant Beaver.Power = 4
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
